<li><strong>Water and freeze damage</strong> from sprinkler lines, plumbing, and roof leaks, including the widespread pipe bursts during Winter Storm Uri in February 2021.</li>
<li><strong>Fire and smoke</strong> affecting tenant spaces, inventory, and building systems.</li>
</ul>

